          "text": "Ore ilo oishakenu embae nemesipa te nkaraki ole latia enye, netiu anaa orinka lo larrabal arashu olalem, arashu embae napi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.25.18"
